ナチュラルガーデン</span>
                <div class="mainTtl animation">SIKIガーデン～音の散策路～</div>
            </h1>
            <div class="img animation"><img src="https://www.rokkosan.com/museum/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2024/03/e8547c50833a0863106a10253b2cc95d.jpg" alt="" class="ofi"></div>
            <div class="bg"></div>
